   "x1": 518.4096069335938,
   "baseline": 91.8621826171875,
   "bottom": 94.70268249511719,
   "text": "its undertaking, property and uncalled capital, and to issue debentures or give any other security for any"
  },
  {
   "page": 3,
   "x0": 76.86614227294922,
   "x1": 340.3486328125,
   "baseline": 105.8621826171875,
   "bottom": 108.70268249511719,
   "text": "debt, liability or obligation of the company or of any third party."
  },
  {
   "page": 3,
   "x0": 76.86614227294922,
   "x1": 518.4094848632812,
   "baseline": 125.8621826171875,
   "bottom": 128.7026824951172,
   "text": "11.3 the directors may from time to time appoint one or more of their number to the office of managing"
  },
  {
   "page": 3,
   "x0": 76.86614227294922,
   "x1": 374.14013671875,
   "baseline": 139.8621826171875,
   "bottom": 142.7026824951172,
   "text": "director, and may delegate to him such of their powers as they think fit."
  },
  {
   "page": 3,
   "x0": 76.86614227294922,
   "x1": 237.3401641845703,
   "baseline": 165.8621826171875,
   "bottom": 168.7786865234375,
   "text": "12. proceedings of directors"
  },
  {
   "page": 3,
   "x0": 76.86614227294922,
   "x1": 518.4097900390625,
   "baseline": 183.8621826171875,
   "bottom": 186.7026824951172,
   "text": "12.1 the directors may meet together for the despatch of business, adjourn and otherwise regulate their"
  },
  {
   "page": 3,
   "x0": 76.86614227294922,
   "x1": 518.4094848632812,
   "baseline": 197.8621826171875,
   "bottom": 200.7026824951172,
   "text": "meetings as they think fit. questions arising at any meeting shall be decided by a majority of votes, and in"
  },
  {
   "page": 3,
   "x0": 76.86614227294922,
   "x1": 419.0467224121094,
   "baseline": 211.8621826171875,
   "bottom": 214.7026824951172,
   "text": "the case of an equality of votes the chairman shall have a second or casting vote."
  },
  {
   "page": 3,
   "x0": 76.86614227294922,
   "x1": 518.4097290039062,
   "baseline": 231.8621826171875,
   "bottom": 234.7026824951172,
   "text": "12.2 a resolution in writing signed by all the directors for the time being entitled to receive notice of a"
  },
  {
   "page": 3,
   "x0": 76.86614227294922,
   "x1": 518.4097290039062,
   "baseline": 245.8621826171875,
   "bottom": 248.7026824951172,
   "text": "meeting of the directors shall be as valid and effectual as if it had been passed at a meeting duly"
  },
  {
   "page": 3,
   "x0": 76.86614227294922,
   "x1": 159.7821502685547,
   "baseline": 259.8621826171875,
   "bottom": 262.70269775390625,
   "text": "convened and held."
  },
  {
   "page": 3,
   "x0": 76.86614227294922,
   "x1": 518.4097900390625,
   "baseline": 279.8621826171875,
   "bottom": 282.70269775390625,
   "text": "12.3 a director may participate in a meeting of directors by means of a telephone conference or any other"
  },
  {
   "page": 3,
   "x0": 76.86614227294922,
   "x1": 518.4096069335938,
   "baseline": 293.8621826171875,
   "bottom": 296.70269775390625,
   "text": "form of communication by which all persons participating in the meeting are able to hear and be heard by"
  },
  {
   "page": 3,
   "x0": 76.86614227294922,
   "x1": 164.51315307617188,
   "baseline": 307.8621826171875,
   "bottom": 310.70269775390625,
   "text": "all other participants."
  },
  {
   "page": 3,
   "x0": 76.86614227294922,
   "x1": 151.2986602783203,
   "baseline": 333.8621826171875,
   "bottom": 336.7786865234375,
   "text": "13. secretary"
  },
  {
   "page": 3,
   "x0": 76.86614227294922,
   "x1": 518.4096069335938,
   "baseline": 351.8621826171875,
   "bottom": 354.70269775390625,
   "text": "the secretary shall be appointed by the directors for such term, at such remuneration and upon such"
  },
  {
   "page": 3,
   "x0": 76.86614227294922,
   "x1": 518.4096069335938,
   "baseline": 365.8621826171875,
   "bottom": 368.70269775390625,
   "text": "conditions as they may think fit, and any secretary so appointed may be removed by them, subject"
  },
  {
   "page": 3,
   "x0": 76.86614227294922,
   "x1": 235.80113220214844,
   "baseline": 379.8621826171875,
   "bottom": 382.70269775390625,
   "text": "always to the requirements of the act."
  },
  {
   "page": 3,
   "x0": 76.86614227294922,
   "x1": 201.420654296875,
   "baseline": 405.8621826171875,
   "bottom": 408.7786865234375,
   "text": "14. accounts and audit"
  },
  {
   "page": 3,
   "x0": 76.86614227294922,
   "x1": 518.40966796875,
   "baseline": 423.8621826171875,
   "bottom": 426.70269775390625,
   "text": "14.1 the directors shall cause proper accounting and other records to be kept, and shall distribute copies"
  },
  {
   "page": 3,
   "x0": 76.86614227294922,
   "x1": 269.07012939453125,
   "baseline": 437.8621826171875,
   "bottom": 440.70269775390625,
   "text": "of financial statements as required by the act."
  },
  {
   "page": 3,
   "x0": 76.86614227294922,
   "x1": 518.409423828125,
   "baseline": 457.8621826171875,
   "bottom": 460.70269775390625,
   "text": "14.2 auditors shall be appointed and their duties regulated in accordance with the act, unless the"
  },
  {
   "page": 3,
   "x0": 76.86614227294922,
   "x1": 325.5476379394531,
   "baseline": 471.8621826171875,
   "bottom": 474.70269775390625,
   "text": "company is exempt from audit requirements under the act."
  },
  {
   "page": 3,
   "x0": 76.86614227294922,
   "x1": 222.03565979003906,
   "baseline": 497.8621826171875,
   "bottom": 500.7786865234375,
   "text": "15. dividends and reserves"
  },
  {
   "page": 3,
   "x0": 76.86614227294922,
   "x1": 518.4096069335938,
   "baseline": 515.8621826171875,
   "bottom": 518.7026977539062,
   "text": "15.1 the company may by ordinary resolution declare dividends, but no dividend shall exceed the"
  },
  {
   "page": 3,
   "x0": 76.86614227294922,
   "x1": 242.1281280517578,
   "baseline": 529.8621826171875,
   "bottom": 532.7026977539062,
   "text": "amount recommended by the directors."
  },
  {
   "page": 3,
   "x0": 76.86614227294922,
   "x1": 518.40966796875,
   "baseline": 549.8621826171875,
   "bottom": 552.7026977539062,
   "text": "15.2 no dividend shall be paid otherwise than out of profits available for distribution in accordance with"
  },
  {
   "page": 3,
   "x0": 76.86614227294922,
   "x1": 109.08064270019531,
   "baseline": 563.8621826171875,
   "bottom": 566.7026977539062,
   "text": "the act."
  },
  {
   "page": 3,
   "x0": 76.86614227294922,
   "x1": 518.409423828125,
   "baseline": 583.8621826171875,
   "bottom": 586.7026977539062,
   "text": "15.3 the directors may, before recommending any dividend, set aside out of the profits of the company"
  },
  {
   "page": 3,
   "x0": 76.86614227294922,
   "x1": 265.88763427734375,
   "baseline": 597.8621826171875,
   "bottom": 600.7026977539062,
   "text": "such sums as they think proper as a reserve."
  },
  {
   "page": 3,
   "x0": 76.86614227294922,
   "x1": 134.9396514892578,
   "baseline": 623.8621826171875,
   "bottom": 626.7786865234375,
   "text": "16. notices"
  },
  {
   "page": 3,
   "x0": 76.86614227294922,
   "x1": 518.40966796875,
   "baseline": 641.8621826171875,
   "bottom": 644.7026977539062,
   "text": "16.1 a notice may be given by the company to any member either personally, by sending it by post to his"
  },
  {
   "page": 3,
   "x0": 76.86614227294922,
   "x1": 518.40966796875,
   "baseline": 655.8621826171875,
   "bottom": 658.7026977539062,
   "text": "registered address, or by electronic communication to the electronic address supplied by him for that"
  },
  {
   "page": 3,
   "x0": 76.86614227294922,
   "x1": 113.83065032958984,
   "baseline": 669.8621826171875,
   "bottom": 672.7026977539062,
   "text": "purpose."
  },
  {
   "page": 3,
   "x0": 76.86614227294922,
   "x1": 518.4097290039062,
   "baseline": 689.8621826171875,
   "bottom": 692.7026977539062,
   "text": "16.2 a notice sent by post shall be deemed to have been served on the day following that on which it was"
  },
  {
   "page": 3,
   "x0": 76.86614227294922,
   "x1": 108.0261459350586,
   "baseline": 703.8621826171875,
   "bottom": 706.7026977539062,
   "text": "posted."
  },
  {
   "page": 3,
   "x0": 486.0469055175781,
   "x1": 524.4094848632812,
   "baseline": 802.2047119140625,
   "bottom": 804.4472045898438,
   "text": "page 4 of 6"
  },
  {
   "page": 4,
   "x0": 76.86614227294922,
   "x1": 150.7666473388672,
   "baseline": 77.8621826171875,
   "bottom": 80.7786865234375,
   "text": "17. winding up"
  },
  {
   "page": 4,
   "x0": 76.86614227294922,
   "x1": 518.4096069335938,
   "baseline": 95.8621826171875,
   "bottom": 98.70268249511719,
   "text": "if the company is wound up, the liquidator may, with the sanction of a special resolution and any other"
  },
  {
   "page": 4,
   "x0": 76.86614227294922,
   "x1": 518.4096069335938,
   "baseline": 109.8621826171875,
   "bottom": 112.70268249511719,
   "text": "sanction required by the act, divide amongst the members in specie the whole or any part of the assets of"
  },
