  {
   "page": 4,
   "x0": 76.86614227294922,
   "x1": 518.4096069335938,
   "baseline": 167.8621826171875,
   "bottom": 170.7026824951172,
   "text": "subject to the act, every director, auditor, secretary or other officer of the company shall be entitled to be"
  },
  {
   "page": 4,
   "x0": 76.86614227294922,
   "x1": 518.4097900390625,
   "baseline": 181.8621826171875,
   "bottom": 184.7026824951172,
   "text": "indemnified out of the assets of the company against any liability incurred by him in defending any"
  },
  {
   "page": 4,
   "x0": 76.86614227294922,
   "x1": 517.1912841796875,
   "baseline": 195.8621826171875,
   "bottom": 198.7026824951172,
   "text": "proceedings, whether civil or criminal, in which judgment is given in his favour or in which he is acquitted."
  },
  {
   "page": 4,
   "x0": 486.0469055175781,
   "x1": 524.4094848632812,
   "baseline": 802.2047119140625,
   "bottom": 804.4472045898438,
   "text": "page 5 of 6"
  },
  {
   "page": 5,
